    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not about \"next steps\" or \"planning.\" that's the problem. it's just more of the same. i see people at their absolute worst, losing everything, and for what? to just survive another day of misery? it feels like we're just prolonging the inevitable. sometimes i wonder if there's any actual point to any of this suffering.",
